        num_pics++;
    }
    ps_stref_picset->ai1_ref_idc[i] = ref_idc;
}
```

If `i1_num_delta_pocs = 15`, the loop runs for i=0 to 15 (16 iterations). In each iteration, if `ref_idc` is 1 or 2, `num_pics` is incremented. So `num_pics` can go from 0 to at most 16. The last write would be `ai2_delta_poc[15]` which is the 16th element (index 0-15 for 16 elements). That's still within bounds of `ai2_delta_poc[MAX_DPB_SIZE]`.

